: \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">in</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"inside\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I live <span class=\\\"strong\\\">in</span> New San Francisco.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">at</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"used to show an exact position or particular place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I met her <span class=\\\"strong\\\">at</span> the bus stop.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">on</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at, near or next to a place/river\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The town is <span class=\\\"strong\\\">on</span> the river.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">by, next to, beside, near</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"not far away in distance\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The girl sat <span class=\\\"strong\\\">next </span> to me.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">between</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the space which separates two places, people or objects\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The town lies halfway <span class=\\\"strong\\\">between </span> Cambridge and Boston.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">behind</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at the back (of)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I hung my jacket <span class=\\\"strong\\\">behind </span> the door.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">in front of</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"further forward than\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She started talking to the woman <span class=\\\"strong\\\">in front of</span> her.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">under</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lower than or covered by \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The dog is <span class=\\\"strong\\\">under </span> the house.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "site", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a place of historical or cultural importance ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Gettysburg is the site of a great battle. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear on a guided tour.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cable car ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a vehicle connected to a cable that pulls it up and down a mountain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am excited to go in a cable car.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "icon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a widely known symbol ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The Statue of Liberty is an American icon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mobster", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who is part of an organized group of criminals ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The famous mobster, Al Capone, spent many years in jail there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "prisoner", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who is kept in a prison", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Did you know that prisoners tried to escape by swimming across the bay?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bay   ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large area of water that is part of an ocean or lake and partly surrounded by land", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The San Francisco bay area is beautiful.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Alcatraz", "type": "name"}, {"content": "name of a famous jail in San Francisco bay ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was sent to Alcatraz.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "crush", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a strong feeling of romantic love ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Aunt Nelly had a crush on a famous actor.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le02ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a 10-line dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include questions and answers, like <span class=\"italic\">Where are we going?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Describe locations and use adjectives.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include 2 prepositions of location like <span class=\"italic\">inside</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Include 4 words with the long <span class=\"italic\">i</span> sound.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a dialogue between a tour guide and tourist.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I include questions and answers.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe locations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I include 4 words with the long <span class=\"italic\">i</span> sound.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le02ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: This coast tour is a great way to see the sights of San Francisco. Which attractions would you like to see?"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "9000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The Golden Gate Bridge is amazing. I hope we can find a great place to take photographs near the water."}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "18000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: You must go on a cable car. They are an icon of San Francisco.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely,  I really want to see Alcatraz, too.  The island prison is so cool and a little mysterious. Are you allowed inside?"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "38000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: No, it's closed. Did you know that prisoners tried to escape by swimming across the bay?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did any prisoners make it?"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 5, "time": "48000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Yes, I think so. The famous mobster, Al Capone, spent many years in jail there.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really? That's neat."}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 6, "time": "59000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: One of my favorite movies was filmed in that prison, too. <span class=\"italic\">Birdman of Alcatraz </span>\u2026 starring Burt Lancaster.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Who's that?"}, {"image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 7, "time": "70000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Oh, a very handsome actor from the 1950s. I had a crush on him.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Aunt Nelly \u2026 that's such a long time ago! You're so funny."}], "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 3}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can say and use the long i sound.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can tell someone where something is located.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can identify key information in a short audio.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "If you are a tour guide, where would you take visitors in your city or town? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Which are the places in your city with some history?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pron